############################
# AI Models
############################
# NOTE: a bare "models/" was removed here - it matched ANY directory
# named "models" anywhere in the repo, including the real source code
# package backend/app/models/ (SQLAlchemy ORM models), silently
# excluding it from git entirely (confirmed via `git ls-files` - none
# of its .py files were tracked). checkpoints/, weights/, and the
# extension patterns below already cover downloaded model artifacts;
# scope a replacement to the actual weights directory if one is
# introduced (e.g. "data/models/"), not a bare "models/".
checkpoints/
weights/
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.pth
*.bin
*.onnx
*.gguf
*.safetensors
############################
# HuggingFace
############################
.cache/
huggingface/
############################
# Vector Database
############################
data/vector_db/*
!data/vector_db/.gitkeep
